{
  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-44066",
    "CVE-2026-44068"
  ],
  "description": "Arjun Basnet discovered that Netatalk improperly validated inputs when\nunmarshalling Spotlight Remote Procedure Call. A remote authenticated\nattacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service or\nobtain sensitive information. (CVE-2026-44066)\n\nArjun Basnet discovered that Netatalk improperly sanitized extended\nattribute path components. A remote authenticated attacker could possibly\nuse this issue to perform path traversal attacks and write to arbitrary\nfiles outside the intended metadata directory. (CVE-2026-44068)",
  "id": "USN-8455-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in Netatalk.",
